@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
title UML state — durable job / baseline 1.0
[*] --> Queued : durable intake
Queued --> Running : claim lease / fence
Running --> Completed : result or pending extraction + outbox committed
Running --> RetryWait : transient error / expired lease
RetryWait --> Queued : backoff elapsed
Running --> Failed : terminal error / attempts exhausted
Failed --> Queued : explicit retry after fix
Queued --> Cancelled : deletion / explicit cancel
Running --> Cancelled : cancel and result fencing
Completed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
note right of Completed
Extraction acceptance has a separate lifecycle.
A completed processing job may leave pending candidates.
end note
@enduml
